MANDATORY ONTOLOGY-FIRST WORKFLOW

Before research, reading arbitrary specifications, or editing code, follow .ontolinkRule/ONTOLOGY-FIRST.md. First run:
python .agents/skills/ontolink-skills/scripts/mediator.py context --state knowledge.owl

If knowledge.owl is missing, bootstrap it with the installed OntoLink mediator and then run context. Use the context packet to choose the eligible task and read only listed artifacts/contracts. Never edit knowledge.owl manually. All state updates must use mediator.py record with the observed --expected-revision. Enforce discover -> design -> plan -> build -> verify -> deliver -> monitor. DONE requires current PASS evidence and exact SHA-256 hashes.
